rtners\">Partners</a><div class=\"nav-dropdown  nav-item dropdown\"><a id=\"media-dropdown\" aria-expanded=\"false\" role=\"button\" class=\"dropdown-toggle nav-link\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"#\">Media</a></div><a class=\"nav-item  nav-link\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a><a class=\"nav-item  nav-link\" href=\"/careers\">Careers</a></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-primary schedule-btn ms-lg-4 btn btn-primary\">Schedule Visit</button></div></div></nav></header><div class=\"navbar-spacer\"></div><div class=\"page-body\"><main class=\"flex-grow-1 main-content\"><div class=\"content-container\"><main style=\"flex: 1 1 0%;\"><div class=\"page-container\"><div class=\"home-page-container\"><section class=\"hero-video-section\"><video class=\"hero-video\" autoplay=\"\" loop=\"\" playsinline=\"\" disablepictureinpicture=\"\" controlslist=\"nodownload noplaybackrate nofullscreen\"><source src=\"/assets/amtz_video-1s_yzl2k.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">Your browser does not support the video tag.</video></section><section class=\"hero-text-section\"><div class=\"container\"><h1 class=\"hero-headline text-start w-100\">Where Dental Innovation Meets Manufacturing Excellence.</h1><p class=\"hero-subtitle mb-4\">Dentic World is a comprehensive innovation hub within the AMTZ ecosystem, providing the infrastructure, expertise, and industry connections required to develop, validate, manufacture, and commercialize dental technologies.From idea to market-ready product, helping innovators and businesses bring breakthrough dental solutions to life.</p><div class=\"hero-cta-group d-flex gap-3\"><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"/services\" class=\"btn-primary btn btn-primary\">Explore Services</a><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"/contact#schedule\" class=\"btn-primary btn btn-primary\">Schedule Visit</a></div></div></section><section class=\"trust-section py-5\"><div class=\"text-center container\"><div class=\"logo-marquee overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"marquee-track d-flex align-items-center\"><div class=\"marquee-logo-card\"><img alt=\"AMTZ\" class=\"marquee-logo\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/Dentic/logos/amtz.jpg\"></div><div class=\"marquee-logo-card\"><img alt=\"INDQ\" class=\"marquee-logo\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/Dentic/logos/indq.png\"></div><div class=\"marquee-logo-card\"><img alt=\"DentoBot\" class=\"marquee-logo\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/Dentic/logos/dentobot.png\"></div><div class=\"marquee-logo-card\"><img alt=\"Center of Excellence\" class=\"marquee-logo\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/Dentic/logos/center.jpg\"></div><div class=\"marquee-logo-card\"><img alt=\"MediMold\" class=\"marquee-logo\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/Dentic/logos/medimold.png\"></div><div class=\"marquee-logo-card\"><img alt=\"MVIC\" class=\"marquee-logo\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/Dentic/logos/medivalley.jpg\"></div><div class=\"marquee-logo-card\"><img alt=\"AMTZ\" class=\"marquee-logo\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/Dentic/logos/amtz.jpg\"></div><div class=\"marquee-logo-card\"><img alt=\"INDQ\" class=\"marquee-logo\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/Dentic/logos/indq.png\"></div><div class=\"marquee-logo-card\"><img alt=\"DentoBot\" class=\"marquee-logo\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/Dentic/logos/dentobot.png\"></div><div class=\"marquee-logo-card\"><img alt=\"Center of Excellence\" class=\"marquee-logo\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/Dentic/logos/center.jpg\"></div><div class=\"marquee-logo-card\"><img alt=\"MediMold\" class=\"marquee-logo\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/Dentic/logos/medimold.png\"></div><div class=\"marquee-logo-card\"><img alt=\"MVIC\" class=\"marquee-logo\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/Dentic/logos/medivalley.jpg\"></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"value-section py-5 bg-white\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"section-title text-center\">Comprehensive Capabilities Under One Roof</h2><div class=\"g-4 justify-content-center row\"><div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\"><div class=\"card-feature capabilities-card\"><img alt=\"Advanced R&amp;D Infrastructure\" class=\"capabilities-card-image\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/Dentic/small/home3.jpg\"><div class=\"card-overlay\"></div><div class=\"card-content\"><h5 class=\"card-title-feature\">Advanced R&amp;D Infrastructure</h5><p class=\"card-desc-feature body-regular\">Access CBCT imaging, intraoral scanners, 5-axis cutting edge equipment, CNC mills, and biocompatibility testing — all within a single integrated facility designed for dental innovation.</p></div><div class=\"accent-bar\"></div></div></div><div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\"><div class=\"card-feature capabilities-card\"><img alt=\"Product Development\" class=\"capabilities-card-image\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/Dentic/small/home4.jpg\"><div class=\"card-overlay\"></div><div class=\"card-content\"><h5 class=\"card-title-feature\">Product Development</h5><p class=\"card-desc-feature body-regular\">Our multidisciplinary team guides dental devices from initial sketches to manufacturing-ready prototypes with regulatory compliance and clinical validation support.</p></div><div class=\"accent-bar\"></div></div></div><div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\"><div class=\"card-feature capabilities-card\"><img alt=\"Manufacturing Services\" class=\"capabilities-card-image\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/Dentic/small/home1.jpg\"><div class=\"card-overlay\"></div><div class=\"card-content\"><h5 class=\"card-title-feature\">Manufacturing Services</h5><p class=\"card-desc-feature body-regular\">Scale production with our certified manufacturing capabilities for dental prosthetics, aligners, surgical guides, and medical devices — ISO 13485-aligned processes ensure quality at scale.</p></div><div class=\"accent-bar\"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"stats-section py-5\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"section-title text-center\">Key Statistics</h2><div class=\"g-4 text-center row\"><div class=\"col-lg-3 col-6\"><div class=\"stat-item\"><div class=\"stat-number\">0+</div><p class=\"stat-label body-regular\">Sq. Ft. Innovation Space</p></div></div><div class=\"col-lg-3 col-6\"><div class=\"stat-item\"><div class=\"stat-number\">0+</div><p class=\"stat-label body-regular\">Machinery &amp; Equipment</p></div></div><div class=\"col-lg-3 col-6\"><div class=\"stat-item\"><div class=\"stat-number\">0+</div><p class=\"stat-label body-regular\">Specialized Departments</p></div></div><div class=\"col-lg-3 col-6\"><div class=\"stat-item\"><div class=\"stat-number\">0</div><p class=\"stat-label body-regular\">Acre AMTZ Ecosystem</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"services-section py-5\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"section-title text-center mb-4\">Services Engineered for Dental Innovation</h2><div class=\"home-services-grid mb-5\"><button class=\"home-service-card active\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-pen-tool home-service-card-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15.707 21.293a1 1 0 0 1-1.414 0l-1.586-1.586a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.414l5.586-5.586a1 1 0 0 1 1.414 0l1.586 1.586a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.414z\"></path><path d=\"m18 13-1.375-6.874a1 1 0 0 0-.746-.776L3.235 2.028a1 1 0 0 0-1.207 1.207L5.35 15.879a1 1 0 0 0 .776.746L13 18\"></path><path d=\"m2.3 2.3 7.286 7.286\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><span class=\"home-service-card-title\">Product Design Studio</span></button><button class=\"home-service-card\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-brain-circuit home-service-card-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.997.125 4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 0 .556 6.588A4 4 0 1 0 12 18Z\"></path><path d=\"M9 13a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3-4\"></path><path d=\"M6.003 5.125A3 3 0 0 0 6.401 6.5\"></path><path d=\"M3.477 10.896a4 4 0 0 1 .585-.396\"></path><path d=\"M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-1.967-.516\"></path><path d=\"M12 13h4\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h6a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h8\"></path><path d=\"M16 8V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2\"></path><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"13\" r=\".5\"></circle><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"3\" r=\".5\"></circle><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"21\" r=\".5\"></circle><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"8\" r=\".5\"></circle></svg><span class=\"home-service-card-title\">Digital Dentistry &amp; AI Lab</span></button><button class=\"home-service-card\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-settings home-service-card-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.671 4.136a2.34 2.34 0 0 1 4.659 0 2.34 2.34 0 0 0 3.319 1.915 2.34 2.34 0 0 1 2.33 4.033 2.34 2.34 0 0 0 0 3.831 2.34 2.34 0 0 1-2.33 4.033 2.34 2.34 0 0 0-3.319 1.915 2.34 2.34 0 0 1-4.659 0 2.34 2.34 0 0 0-3.32-1.915 2.34 2.34 0 0 1-2.33-4.033 2.34 2.34 0 0 0 0-3.831A2.34 2.34 0 0 1 6.35 6.051a2.34 2.34 0 0 0 3.319-1.915\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><span class=\"home-service-card-title\">Engineering &amp; Hardware Lab</span></button><button class=\"home-service-card\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-factory home-service-card-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 16h.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 16h.01\"></path><path d=\"M3 19a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.769-.422l-4.462 2.844A.5.5 0 0 1 15 10.5v-2a.5.5 0 0 0-.769-.422L9.77 10.922A.5.5 0 0 1 9 10.5V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M8 16h.01\"></path></svg><span class=\"home-service-card-title\">Pilot Production Lab</span></button><button class=\"home-service-card\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check home-service-card-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span class=\"home-service-card-title\">Testing &amp; Validation Space</span></button><button class=\"home-service-card\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rocket home-service-card-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5\"></path><path d=\"M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09\"></path><path d=\"M9 12a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.4 22.4 0 0 1-4 2z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 .05 5 .05\"></path></svg><span class=\"home-service-card-title\">Startup Incubation Bay</span></button></div><div class=\"selected-reference mt-5\" style=\"background-image: url(&quot;/Dentic/small/home5.jpg&quot;);\"><div class=\"selected-content px-5 pb-5\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4) 50%, transparent 100%); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; width: 100%; gap: 24px;\"><div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%;\"><h2 class=\"section-title\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7) 0px 2px 12px; margin: 0px;\">Product Design Studio</h2><p class=\"section-subtitle\" style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92); text-align: left; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6) 0px 1px 6px; font-weight: 500; margin: 10px 0px 0px;\">Transform concepts into manufacturable dental devices</p></div><div style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\"><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"/services/product-development\" class=\"btn-primary btn btn-primary\">Learn More</a></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"incubation-section py-5\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"incubation-content text-center\"><h2 class=\"section-title incubation-heading\">Launch Your Dental Innovation</h2><p class=\"body-large incubation-text\">The Dentic World Dental Innovation Incubation Program provides structured support for dental entrepreneurs and researchers. From workspace to mentorship, funding guidance to manufacturing support — we accelerate your path to market.</p><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"/incubation\" class=\"btn-primary incubation-btn mt-4 btn btn-primary\">Apply to Incubation Program &nbsp;→</a></div></div></section><section class=\"final-cta-section py-5 text-center\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"section-title\">Ready to Transform Your Dental Innovation?</h2><p class=\"body-large\">Connect with our team to discuss your project, schedule a facility tour, or explore partnership opportunities.</p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-center gap-4 flex-wrap mt-4\"><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"/contact\" class=\"btn-primary btn btn-primary\">Contact Us</a><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"/contact#schedule\" class=\"btn-primary btn btn-primary\">Schedule Visit</a></div></div></section></div></div></main></div></main></div><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"footer-container container-fluid\"><div class=\"footer-row footer-modern row\"><div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-6 col-12\"><div class=\"footer-brand-block\"><a class=\"footer